    <name>
      <text>Combinations 1 - Evaluating nCr</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) Evaluate \(_{ {@pn@} }C_{ {@pr@} }\).</p>
<p>\(_{ {@pn@} }C_{ {@pr@} } = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>(b) Evaluate \(_{ {@pn2@} }C_{ {@pr2@} }\).</p>
<p>\(_{ {@pn2@} }C_{ {@pr2@} } = \) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>\(_{ {@pn@} }C_{ {@pr@} } = \dfrac{ {@pn@}!}{ {@pr@}!\,({@pn@}-{@pr@})!} = \dfrac{ {@pn@}!}{ {@pr@}!\,{@pn-pr@}!} = {@ta1@}\)</p>
<p>\(_{ {@pn2@} }C_{ {@pr2@} } = \dfrac{ {@pn2@}!}{ {@pr2@}!\,({@pn2@}-{@pr2@})!} = \dfrac{ {@pn2@}!}{ {@pr2@}!\,{@pn2-pr2@}!} = {@ta2@}\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
